  "notes": "参る is the humble form for both ⟦{行|い}く→行く：00119_iku⟧ and ⟦{来|く}る→来る：00254_kuru⟧, as well as the standard term for visiting shrines/temples.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{自動詞|じどうし}→自動詞：10977_jidoushi⟧ (intransitive)\n- No standard transitive pair\n- Pattern: 参る\n\nSPECIAL USAGE:\n- 参った can also mean 'I give up' or express being overwhelmed\n\nKEIGO TYPE:\n- ⟦{謙譲語|けんじょうご}→謙譲語：15869_kenjougo⟧: Humble language\n- Honorific equivalent: ⟦いらっしゃる→いらっしゃる：01295_irassharu⟧",
